MODULE: RestartLosesPoison
TARGET: RestartPreservesDurable
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: receiver reconstruction loses durable poison and quarantine
PERTURBS: Restart

--- FIND
    /\ age' = [r \in Ids |-> Timeout + 1]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<cursor, sent, queue, applied, parked, mode, bad, space,
--- REPLACE
    /\ age' = [r \in Ids |-> Timeout + 1]
    /\ mode' = [r \in Ids |-> "fresh"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<cursor, sent, queue, applied, parked, bad, space,
--- END
